* ES-7 fixture: READ RESULT SET with loop body and END-RESULT terminator
* Demonstrates READ RESULT SET parsing with structured loop form.
* - CALLDBPROC to establish a result set
* - READ RESULT SET loop with body containing INCLUDE (non-CALLNAT/PERFORM statement)
* - Terminated with END-RESULT
* - Zero diagnostics expected for valid syntax

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #RS (A20)
  1 #ROW (A100)
END-DEFINE

CALLDBPROC 'GET_DATA'

READ RESULT SET #RS INTO #ROW
  INCLUDE COPY-RECORD
END-RESULT

END
